  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Building and Academic freedom</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will carry out activities in the form of meetings, trainings, awareness campaigns that will strengthen COLAZ to be able to ensure gender equality, reduction in discrimination and victimization of lecturers and the democratization of tertiary institutions so that freedom of expression is exercise without fear.</narrative>
  </description>
